flowchart TD
    A[Client visits Landing] --> B[Frontend requests GET /api/catalog/prototypes]
    B --> C{Filters?}
    C -->|category, price, search| D[api-core queries PostgreSQL with filters]
    C -->|no filters| D
    D --> E[Results cached in Redis - short TTL]
    E --> F[Frontend renders CatalogGrid]
    F --> G[Client browses prototypes]
    G --> H{Action?}
    H -->|Search/Filter| I[Update filters, re-fetch with combined params]
    I --> D
    H -->|Click prototype| J[View PrototypeDetail - gallery, specs, delivery estimate]
    H -->|Buy button| K[Redirect to Direct Purchase - Flow A]
    H -->|Request custom quote| L[Redirect to Custom Quote - Flow B]
    H -->|Complaints| M[Redirect to Complaints form]

    subgraph SSE[Real-time Sync via SSE]
        N[Admin updates prototype] --> O[PostgreSQL updated]
        O --> P[Redis cache invalidated]
        O --> Q[Publish SSE event: prototype.updated]
        Q --> R[Landing receives event]
        R --> S[Merge into local state by id]
    end

    Q --> T{Event type?}
    T -->|prototype.updated| U[Update price/stock/active in UI]
    T -->|prototype.deactivated| V[Show unavailable notice, disable Buy button]

    S --> U

    style SSE fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0288d1
